[[Open This|5.2 How to install a test Debian package]]

---

Assuming that you have executed sudo apt update earlier, you can now type and execute this command

```bash
sudo apt install ncal
```

in the SSH session, which will install the ncal package.

Once you’ve done that, if you enter cal or cal 2024 command, you should see a calendar presented in the terminal.

